 ## Overview
-This method renders multi-variate volume data by mapping hierarchical clusters of feature vectors to transfer function parameters (color, opacity, size) for direct volume rendering, enabling interactive exploration via cluster tree and parallel coordinates widgets [S1, unofficial].
+This method renders multi-variate volume data by mapping hierarchical clusters of feature vectors to transfer function parameters (color, opacity, size) for direct volume rendering, enabling interactive exploration via cluster tree and parallel coordinates widgets [S1, unofficial]. It sets itself apart from standard direct volume ray casting by decoupling classification from rendering, using post-classification with nearest-neighbor interpolation to allow real-time cluster modification without retransmitting voxel data to the GPU [S1, unofficial].
 
